SUMMARY:Shadowland Theatre presents A Tale of Two Parks
DESCRIPTION:Free Arts Workshops and Performances. A Tale of Two Parks takes participants and audiences of all ages on a fun and artful exploration of wildlife\, ecology and community in Crescent Town’s neighbouring parks\, Dentonia and Taylor Creek. Shadowland Theatre artists will be in residence at both parks with creative activities on the themes of animal and plant life. Create costumes and puppets\, learn music and songs\, share stories\, experience Indigenous teachings and go on nature walks. ALL AGES WELCOME. Dentonia Park: July 19\, 20\, 21 3-6pm daily. Taylor Creek Park July 22-23\, 12-5pm daily.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/shadowland-theatre-presents-a-tale-of-two-parks/
LOCATION:Dentonia Park\, 80 Thyra Ave\, Toronto\, M4C 5G3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/21140325/SLT-A-Tale-of-Two-Parks.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Shadowland Theatre":MAILTO:info@shadowlandtheatre.ca
END:VEVENT
